.DS_Store
out/
*.log

# Blender source scenes are large and not part of the engine.
*.blend

# Generated output
scratch/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Baked lightmaps (LightCache), rebuilt on demand
.lightcache/

# The Blender converter, kept beside the engine but not part of it.
/tools/

# Every other build put beside that one, under whatever name: out-test/ holds the unit tests,
# which are compiled beside the engine and never into it; out-base/ holds the other half of an
# A/B benchmark; out.tmp/ is what build.sh compiles into and leaves behind when javac fails.
# These were listed one at a time until an out-hq/ from some experiment sat untracked for days,
# one `git add -A` away from being in the history for good.
out-*/
out.tmp/
